{"5179590":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"Flurst","steam_appid":5179590,"required_age":0,"is_free":false,"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One pile. Three layers of cards. Plenty of ways for a good hand to go wrong.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Flurst is a strategic card-shedding game about getting rid of every card before the table turns on you. Play equal or higher, lay down matching ranks together, or take the whole centre pile when your options run out.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5179590\/extras\/790c76276b5ba3478d22c913dfdd26ab.poster.avif?t=1793740063\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5179590\/extras\/790c76276b5ba3478d22c913dfdd26ab.webm?t=1793740063\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5179590\/extras\/790c76276b5ba3478d22c913dfdd26ab.mp4?t=1793740063\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >PLAY THE HAND YOU'RE DEALT<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep your hand topped up while the draw deck lasts. Once the deck is empty and your hand is gone, move to your face-up table cards and finally the face-down cards underneath. Those last plays are blind. If the card doesn't fit, the whole pile comes straight back to you.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5179590\/extras\/87848c7faed2412931d91f738ef58559.poster.avif?t=1793740063\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5179590\/extras\/87848c7faed2412931d91f738ef58559.webm?t=1793740063\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5179590\/extras\/87848c7faed2412931d91f738ef58559.mp4?t=1793740063\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >SPECIAL CARDS, BIG SWINGS<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some cards are an escape hatch. Some are a trap.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- 2 resets the pile and gives you another action.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- 10 burns the pile and lets you play again.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- 5 looks through to the card underneath.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Four matching ranks burn the pile.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every special rule is optional, so you decide how wild the table gets.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5179590\/extras\/afa96caf02d4519c6c5cdaa06d2409e9.poster.avif?t=1793740063\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5179590\/extras\/afa96caf02d4519c6c5cdaa06d2409e9.webm?t=1793740063\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5179590\/extras\/afa96caf02d4519c6c5cdaa06d2409e9.mp4?t=1793740063\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >MAKE THE TABLE YOURS<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build a quick, familiar match or turn the table into something ridiculous.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Play against one to five bots or your friends.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Choose 1–10 decks, a 1–13 card starting hand, and 1–5 table-card slots.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Set the bot pace to Fast, Normal, or Relaxed.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Arrange your visible table cards before the first turn—or disable planning altogether.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Prefer to watch the chaos? Let the bots take your seat and spectate the match.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5179590\/extras\/2fc0e1795f4446db5581f5d4f0e9c60a.poster.avif?t=1793740063\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5179590\/extras\/2fc0e1795f4446db5581f5d4f0e9c60a.webm?t=1793740063\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5179590\/extras\/2fc0e1795f4446db5581f5d4f0e9c60a.mp4?t=1793740063\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The goal is simple. The pile is not. Get rid of everything—and don't be the one left holding it.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5179590\/extras\/76e538ba82a0e49ebbb80376b0f32913.poster.avif?t=1793740063\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5179590\/extras\/76e538ba82a0e49ebbb80376b0f32913.webm?t=1793740063\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5179590\/extras\/76e538ba82a0e49ebbb80376b0f32913.mp4?t=1793740063\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p>","about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One pile. Three layers of cards. Plenty of ways for a good hand to go wrong.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Flurst is a strategic card-shedding game about getting rid of every card before the table turns on you. Play equal or higher, lay down matching ranks together, or take the whole centre pile when your options run out.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5179590\/extras\/790c76276b5ba3478d22c913dfdd26ab.poster.avif?t=1793740063\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5179590\/extras\/790c76276b5ba3478d22c913dfdd26ab.webm?t=1793740063\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5179590\/extras\/790c76276b5ba3478d22c913dfdd26ab.mp4?t=1793740063\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >PLAY THE HAND YOU'RE DEALT<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep your hand topped up while the draw deck lasts. Once the deck is empty and your hand is gone, move to your face-up table cards and finally the face-down cards underneath. Those last plays are blind. If the card doesn't fit, the whole pile comes straight back to you.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5179590\/extras\/87848c7faed2412931d91f738ef58559.poster.avif?t=1793740063\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5179590\/extras\/87848c7faed2412931d91f738ef58559.webm?t=1793740063\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5179590\/extras\/87848c7faed2412931d91f738ef58559.mp4?t=1793740063\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >SPECIAL CARDS, BIG SWINGS<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some cards are an escape hatch. Some are a trap.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- 2 resets the pile and gives you another action.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- 10 burns the pile and lets you play again.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- 5 looks through to the card underneath.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Four matching ranks burn the pile.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every special rule is optional, so you decide how wild the table gets.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5179590\/extras\/afa96caf02d4519c6c5cdaa06d2409e9.poster.avif?t=1793740063\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5179590\/extras\/afa96caf02d4519c6c5cdaa06d2409e9.webm?t=1793740063\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5179590\/extras\/afa96caf02d4519c6c5cdaa06d2409e9.mp4?t=1793740063\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >MAKE THE TABLE YOURS<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build a quick, familiar match or turn the table into something ridiculous.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Play against one to five bots or your friends.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Choose 1–10 decks, a 1–13 card starting hand, and 1–5 table-card slots.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Set the bot pace to Fast, Normal, or Relaxed.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Arrange your visible table cards before the first turn—or disable planning altogether.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Prefer to watch the chaos? Let the bots take your seat and spectate the match.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5179590\/extras\/2fc0e1795f4446db5581f5d4f0e9c60a.poster.avif?t=1793740063\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5179590\/extras\/2fc0e1795f4446db5581f5d4f0e9c60a.webm?t=1793740063\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5179590\/extras\/2fc0e1795f4446db5581f5d4f0e9c60a.mp4?t=1793740063\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The goal is simple. The pile is not. Get rid of everything—and don't be the one left holding it.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5179590\/extras\/76e538ba82a0e49ebbb80376b0f32913.poster.avif?t=1793740063\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5179590\/extras\/76e538ba82a0e49ebbb80376b0f32913.webm?t=1793740063\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5179590\/extras\/76e538ba82a0e49ebbb80376b0f32913.mp4?t=1793740063\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p>","short_description":"Flurst is a fast, strategic card game for solo play against up to five bots or to battle it out with friends. Play matching cards, reset or burn the pile, tune the house rules, and survive your face-up and face-down table cards to empty everything first and get Flurst!","supported_languages":"English<strong>*<\/strong><br><strong>*<\/strong>languages with full audio support","header_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5179590\/9586c72af0e1367e13f6f478e620726f55d7c503\/header.jpg?t=1793740063","capsule_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5179590\/8a6bd75c3598449ddd64745e99422f618da4e0fd\/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1793740063","capsule_imagev5":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5179590\/8a6bd75c3598449ddd64745e99422f618da4e0fd\/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1793740063","website":null,"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> Windows 10 64-bit<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> Intel Core i3-2100 or AMD FX-4100<br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 4 GB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>Graphics:<\/strong> Intel HD Graphics 510, AMD Radeon R5, or equivalent with DirectX 12 support<br><\/li><li><strong>DirectX:<\/strong> Version 12<br><\/li><li><strong>Storage:<\/strong> 500 MB available space<br><\/li><li><strong>Sound Card:<\/strong> Any Windows-compatible audio device<\/li><\/ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> Windows 11 64-bit<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> Intel Core i5-6600K or AMD Ryzen 5 1600<br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 8 GB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>Graphics:<\/strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 1050 or AMD Radeon RX 460<br><\/li><li><strong>DirectX:<\/strong> Version 12<br><\/li><li><strong>Storage:<\/strong> 500 MB available space<br><\/li><li><strong>Sound Card:<\/strong> Any Windows-compatible audio device<\/li><\/ul>"},"mac_requirements":[],"linux_requirements":[],"developers":["Zynq"],"publishers":["Zynq"],"price_overview":{"currency":"USD","initial":499,"final":499,"discount_percent":0,"initial_formatted":"","final_formatted":"$4.99"},"packages":[1792681],"package_groups":[{"name":"default","title":"Buy Flurst","description":"","selection_text":"Select a purchase option","save_text":"","display_type":0,"is_recurring_subscription":"false","subs":[{"packageid":1792681,"percent_savings_text":" ","percent_savings":0,"option_text":"Flurst - $4.99","option_description":"","can_get_free_license":"0","is_free_license":false,"price_in_cents_with_discount":499}]}],"platforms":{"windows":true,"mac":false,"linux":false},"categories":[{"id":2,"description":"Single-player"},{"id":1,"description":"Multi-player"},{"id":49,"description":"PvP"},{"id":36,"description":"Online PvP"},{"id":22,"description":"Steam Achievements"},{"id":68,"description":"Custom Volume Controls"},{"id":78,"description":"Adjustable Difficulty"},{"id":76,"description":"Mouse Only Option"},{"id":80,"description":"#category_playable_at_your_own_pace"},{"id":74,"description":"Playable without Timed Input"},{"id":15,"description":"Stats"},{"id":62,"description":"Family Sharing"}],"genres":[{"id":"4","description":"Casual"},{"id":"23","description":"Indie"},{"id":"2","description":"Strategy"}],"screenshots":[{"id":0,"path_thumbnail":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5179590\/59c6017098eca526007bc94035500c925a90d43c\/ss_59c6017098eca526007bc94035500c925a90d43c.600x338.jpg?t=1793740063","path_full":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5179590\/59c6017098eca526007bc94035500c925a90d43c\/ss_59c6017098eca526007bc94035500c925a90d43c.1920x1080.jpg?t=1793740063"},{"id":1,"path_thumbnail":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5179590\/76987b97f27b337d3390c1bc301c209a2794702b\/ss_76987b97f27b337d3390c1bc301c209a2794702b.600x338.jpg?t=1793740063","path_full":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5179590\/76987b97f27b337d3390c1bc301c209a2794702b\/ss_76987b97f27b337d3390c1bc301c209a2794702b.1920x1080.jpg?t=1793740063"},{"id":2,"path_thumbnail":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5179590\/595d8f49f1f5a49a97057ff17c8a3b441d8d0914\/ss_595d8f49f1f5a49a97057ff17c8a3b441d8d0914.600x338.jpg?t=1793740063","path_full":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5179590\/595d8f49f1f5a49a97057ff17c8a3b441d8d0914\/ss_595d8f49f1f5a49a97057ff17c8a3b441d8d0914.1920x1080.jpg?t=1793740063"},{"id":3,"path_thumbnail":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5179590\/ba6d4de875a76e33256de30303440236c01117b8\/ss_ba6d4de875a76e33256de30303440236c01117b8.600x338.jpg?t=1793740063","path_full":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/stor